.923" end="02:58.323">the </span><span begin="02:58.323" end="02:58.732">things </span><span begin="02:58.732" end="02:59.491">I </span><span begin="02:59.491" end="03:00.291">did</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.763" end="03:06.860"><span begin="03:03.763" end="03:04.083">And </span><span begin="03:04.083" end="03:04.435">what </span><span begin="03:04.435" end="03:04.851">a </span><span begin="03:04.851" end="03:06.035">lesson </span><span begin="03:06.035" end="03:06.860">learned</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.235" end="03:12.347"><span begin="03:10.235" end="03:10.571">I </span><span begin="03:10.571" end="03:11.019">died </span><span begin="03:11.019" end="03:11.396">when </span><span begin="03:11.396" end="03:11.811">I </span><span begin="03:11.811" end="03:12.347">lost</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.091" end="03:18.543"><span begin="03:13.091" end="03:15.511">You </span><span begin="03:16.270" end="03:18.543">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:19.487" end="03:24.935"><span begin="03:19.487" end="03:21.815">You </span><span begin="03:22.655" end="03:24.935">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:26.015" end="03:27.351"><span begin="03:26.015" end="03:27.087">You </span><span begin="03:27.087" end="03:27.351">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:27.351" end="03:31.733"><span begin="03:27.351" end="03:28.349">You </span><span begin="03:29.821" end="03:31.733">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:32.701" end="03:33.672"><span begin="03:32.701" end="03:33.374">You </span><span begin="03:33.374" end="03:33.672">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:33.672" end="03:39.245"><span begin="03:33.672" end="03:35.661">You </span><span begin="03:36.565" end="03:39.245">you</span></p></div></body></tt>